WEBVTT

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:05.810
What's wrong, Laila?!

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:12.510
This is bad...

00:00:13.490 --> 00:00:14.680
Yes.

00:00:16.030 --> 00:00:19.520
What on earth happened here?!

00:00:35.990 --> 00:00:38.080
--What was that?
--That way!

00:00:43.170 --> 00:00:46.700
I'm so happy to run into
you two in a place like this!

00:00:46.700 --> 00:00:50.270
'Cause now we have a gift
to take back to Eiretsu!

00:00:50.270 --> 00:00:57.280
It's okay, Linlin. I'm here.
There's nothing to be afraid of.

00:00:57.280 --> 00:01:01.120
Now close your eyes.

00:01:01.120 --> 00:01:06.660
Yeah, we'll finish this
while her eyes are shut.

00:01:06.660 --> 00:01:11.030
I <i>am</i> a member of the Zhang Jin Squad!
I won't go down without a fight!

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:14.020
There is no Zhang Jin Squad anymore!

00:01:21.640 --> 00:01:25.710
Ouch! What the hell are you doing?!
Butt out, you outsiders!

00:01:25.710 --> 00:01:29.710
I dunno what's going on,
but quit harassing weaker people!

00:01:29.710 --> 00:01:32.750
You guys seem much more
like the bad guys here!

00:01:32.750 --> 00:01:36.250
Bad guys? How so?!

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:38.980
What do you mean, "How so?"

00:01:40.420 --> 00:01:44.260
Doing this sort of thing
<i>does</i> give off "bad guy" vibes...

00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:01.610
Wh-who are these guys?!

00:02:01.610 --> 00:02:04.370
That just leaves you!

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:10.870
What the...?

00:02:15.560 --> 00:02:18.620
Get outta here!
You guys don't stand a chance!

00:02:19.700 --> 00:02:20.960
Hosei!

00:02:20.960 --> 00:02:23.570
He caught my arrow with his bare hands.

00:02:23.570 --> 00:02:25.730
Take my advice and get outta here!

00:02:25.730 --> 00:02:29.360
Damn! We'll get you for this next time!

00:02:33.440 --> 00:02:36.280
Sh-she's cute...!

00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:43.250
What's your probl--?!

00:02:44.620 --> 00:02:48.220
You're not from around here!
Where are you from?

00:02:48.220 --> 00:02:51.990
How old are you? Do you have
a boyfriend? You don't, do you?

00:02:51.990 --> 00:02:54.960
I'm Hosei! What's your name?

00:02:54.960 --> 00:02:56.600
L-Laila...

00:02:56.600 --> 00:03:00.270
Laila, huh? That's a cute name!

00:03:00.270 --> 00:03:02.500
Stay away from Laila!

00:03:02.500 --> 00:03:04.300
You're annoying!

00:03:15.980 --> 00:03:17.520
What was all that?

00:03:17.520 --> 00:03:21.520
I dunno what's going on,
but I smell stupidity in the air.

00:03:21.520 --> 00:03:25.630
Hey, Chinjo. Can I open my eyes now?

00:03:25.630 --> 00:03:28.930
Yes, it's okay now, Linlin.

00:03:34.800 --> 00:03:37.800
Could he be...?

00:03:43.950 --> 00:03:46.450
Thank you. You were a great help.

00:03:46.450 --> 00:03:51.850
My name is Chinjo. She's Linlin.

00:03:51.850 --> 00:03:55.520
I am Ryuko. She's Laila.

00:03:55.520 --> 00:03:59.460
And the one stuffing his face
with sweet buns is Taito.

00:03:59.460 --> 00:04:01.860
We're on a journey to the capital.

00:04:02.800 --> 00:04:07.700
This place seems quite different
from the last time I was here...

00:04:07.700 --> 00:04:12.710
Yes, this was originally
a prosperous posting town.

00:04:12.710 --> 00:04:16.850
The town's prosperity was supported by
the Zhang Jin Squad, the self defense force.

00:04:16.850 --> 00:04:24.250
The previous leader passed away
three years ago, and he had no male heirs.

00:04:24.250 --> 00:04:26.660
So there was a fight over succession?

00:04:26.660 --> 00:04:31.360
Yes. A man named Eiretsu
was the leader's right hand man.

00:04:31.360 --> 00:04:34.830
Linlin here is the leader's daughter.

00:04:34.830 --> 00:04:35.860
Get outta there!

00:04:35.860 --> 00:04:37.500
What about government officials?

00:04:37.500 --> 00:04:41.940
If there <i>were</i> officials, there would be
no need for a self defense force.

00:04:41.940 --> 00:04:46.840
I'm an orphan. I owe
the leader for taking me in.

00:04:46.840 --> 00:04:50.850
Linlin is an orphan as well now.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:55.850
I want to change this town back to a place
where she can live without worry.

00:04:55.850 --> 00:04:59.350
And for my friends who were killed by Eiretsu.

00:04:59.350 --> 00:05:02.120
For your friends...

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:03.390
Taito...

00:05:03.390 --> 00:05:07.560
How many of 'em are there?
Where are they?!

00:05:07.560 --> 00:05:11.770
Good grief. I guess it's too late
to tell you to stay out of this.

00:05:11.770 --> 00:05:14.400
Not that I plan to stop you, though.

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:18.110
Old man! Booze!

00:05:18.110 --> 00:05:21.410
I-I have no alcohol for the likes of you!

00:05:22.940 --> 00:05:24.210
What did you say?!

00:05:24.210 --> 00:05:26.650
Hey! Quit it!

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:28.280
You...!

00:05:28.280 --> 00:05:30.990
Eiretsu! These are the guys!

00:05:30.990 --> 00:05:33.460
<i>You're</i> Eiretsu?!

00:05:33.460 --> 00:05:38.960
Oh? I hear you paid my men
a nice favor earlier.

00:05:38.960 --> 00:05:41.790
You look well, Chinjo.

00:05:42.960 --> 00:05:45.730
Old man! Drinks and food, now!

00:05:45.730 --> 00:05:49.100
What the hell?! You have a big
attitude for someone who's weak!

00:05:49.100 --> 00:05:51.800
That's 'cause I'm here.

00:05:57.980 --> 00:06:00.240
You! You're that jerk with the bow!

00:06:01.150 --> 00:06:03.990
Meeting twice like this
is more than just coincidence!

00:06:03.990 --> 00:06:09.820
C'mon, Laila! Won't you come to my place?
You can eat all you want, too!

00:06:11.130 --> 00:06:14.830
What the hell are you saying?!
We teamed up with <i>them</i> just now!

00:06:14.830 --> 00:06:15.500
Huh?

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:19.000
So you can leave now! Shoo! Shoo!

00:06:19.000 --> 00:06:22.170
Wait, are you Laila's man or something?!

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:23.040
Man?

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:26.110
You idiot! She's my sister!

00:06:26.110 --> 00:06:28.440
Y-you're her brother?

00:06:31.810 --> 00:06:35.480
--You look nothing alike!
--Even if we don't, I'm still her brother!

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:38.450
Chinjo! Linlin!

00:06:38.450 --> 00:06:39.940
You're all right!

00:06:41.660 --> 00:06:45.790
I was worried when I heard
you went to visit the leader's grave.

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:48.700
We'll put you in some graves too!

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:57.870
I think I'll pass. Don't want my bow
to get broken again and all!

00:06:58.970 --> 00:07:00.870
This alcohol is terrible.

00:07:05.480 --> 00:07:09.080
If you change your mind,
I'll be in the mansion up the road!

00:07:11.220 --> 00:07:14.520
Get close to Laila again and you'll be sorry!

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:17.060
Who is that archer?

00:07:17.060 --> 00:07:21.520
A drifter Eiretsu recently
hired as a bodyguard.

00:07:23.270 --> 00:07:25.230
What's the matter?

00:07:25.230 --> 00:07:28.240
Oh, I'm just a little curious about something...

00:07:28.240 --> 00:07:30.070
Curious?

00:07:44.250 --> 00:07:46.520
Be quiet!

00:07:51.790 --> 00:07:53.860
Huh?

00:07:53.860 --> 00:07:55.450
Ryuko...?

00:07:59.300 --> 00:08:02.790
No... This isn't it...

00:08:03.870 --> 00:08:05.860
Neither is this...

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:09.970
Is it not here either?

00:08:23.490 --> 00:08:24.890
Don't shoot.

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:32.400
You...! What do you want,
waltzing in here all by yourself?!

00:08:32.400 --> 00:08:36.000
I've come to ask you something.

00:08:36.000 --> 00:08:38.340
Stay away! I'll shoot!

00:08:41.510 --> 00:08:43.270
What is that?!

00:08:44.010 --> 00:08:49.350
I've taken the energy your body
emanates and channeled it through my own.

00:08:49.350 --> 00:08:51.950
Now I'll channel my energy into you.

00:08:57.660 --> 00:09:01.330
Just as I thought.
That is the pattern of Phecda.

00:09:01.330 --> 00:09:02.660
What?!

00:09:02.660 --> 00:09:06.300
According to lore, each
of the seven Dipper Bearers

00:09:06.300 --> 00:09:09.800
carries a weapon matching his attributes.

00:09:09.800 --> 00:09:13.780
And the Divine Warrior
Phecda's weapon is the bow.

00:09:13.780 --> 00:09:15.440
You can't be serious!

00:09:16.850 --> 00:09:21.480
You've yet to find a bow
that can withstand your energy.

00:09:21.480 --> 00:09:26.320
This arrow that burst before my
very eyes this afternoon is clear proof.

00:09:26.320 --> 00:09:31.520
And, these patterns we bear
are proof of it as well.

00:09:34.560 --> 00:09:35.960
Why?

00:09:35.960 --> 00:09:38.830
Why would one of the Five Divine Warriors

00:09:38.830 --> 00:09:41.370
serve as bodyguard to a person like that?

00:09:41.370 --> 00:09:45.140
Five Divine Warriors? I dunno
what you're talking about!

00:09:45.140 --> 00:09:49.040
I'm only trying to do what my master said!

00:09:49.040 --> 00:09:51.310
What your master said?

00:09:55.380 --> 00:10:01.020
Hosei. Find your weapon.
A weapon worthy of you.

00:10:03.560 --> 00:10:07.260
What's the matter?
What did your master tell you to do?

00:10:07.260 --> 00:10:10.330
Shut up. It's none of your business!

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:14.170
Now get lost! Or else!

00:10:15.170 --> 00:10:18.940
Very well. I will leave for today.

00:10:18.940 --> 00:10:20.910
But please remember this:

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:25.010
The Dubhe has appeared,
as has the Alkaid, which is now active.

00:10:25.010 --> 00:10:28.180
Both of the Celestial Deities have arrived.

00:10:28.180 --> 00:10:34.460
If you insist on joining the Dubhe,
then I will destroy you with all my might.

00:10:34.460 --> 00:10:38.260
Dubhe? Alkaid? I have no idea
what you're talking about!

00:10:38.260 --> 00:10:39.460
You don't know?

00:10:39.460 --> 00:10:43.130
That's fine, then.
Someday you will come to know.

00:10:43.130 --> 00:10:45.760
Such is the karma of the stars.

00:10:57.780 --> 00:10:59.440
I can't read it.

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:00.780
I can only read the character for "bow."

00:11:00.780 --> 00:11:02.380
"Bow"
I can only read the character for "bow."

00:11:06.220 --> 00:11:08.420
It's me, Hosei.

00:11:08.420 --> 00:11:11.390
Oh, Eiretsu. Why are you here?

00:11:11.390 --> 00:11:14.730
I could ask you the same thing.

00:11:14.730 --> 00:11:17.220
Say, what is this?

00:11:20.500 --> 00:11:24.410
A list of new weapons I'm
acquiring for the final showdown.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:26.310
New weapons are on the way?

00:11:26.310 --> 00:11:29.810
Yes. I'm putting them in here tomorrow night.

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:33.820
And then we're going to
eradicate those guys at sunup!

00:11:33.820 --> 00:11:36.180
I'm counting on you too, Hosei!

00:11:36.180 --> 00:11:39.450
The day after tomorrow, then? Got it.

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:41.990
By the way, what is this?

00:11:41.990 --> 00:11:43.830
What about it?

00:11:43.830 --> 00:11:48.660
As your bodyguard, I should know
what kind of weapons you'll be getting.

00:11:48.660 --> 00:11:51.930
I use bows. This is a bow, right?

00:11:51.930 --> 00:11:56.970
Yes. The Shuang Chan Bow,
a bow of peerless strength.

00:11:56.970 --> 00:11:58.960
Shuang Chan Bow...

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:09.180
So the star is moving...

00:12:09.180 --> 00:12:16.180
Act, led by the karma of the stars,
Divine Warrior Phecda...

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:20.800
Tonight?!

00:12:20.800 --> 00:12:24.530
Yes. They're apparently going to
acquire powerful weapons.

00:12:24.530 --> 00:12:29.000
They plan to launch an attack
against you at sunrise.

00:12:29.000 --> 00:12:31.410
I see. So this is it...

00:12:31.410 --> 00:12:35.880
In that case, et's sst ttem ooday!

00:12:35.880 --> 00:12:40.310
Don't talk while you're eating!
We can't tell what you're saying!

00:12:41.680 --> 00:12:45.090
I said let's just beat 'em up today then!

00:12:45.090 --> 00:12:47.060
Plus, if we know weapons are coming,

00:12:47.060 --> 00:12:49.420
let's snatch them too while we're at it!

00:12:49.420 --> 00:12:50.860
Interesting.

00:12:51.730 --> 00:12:55.160
That's good thinking,
especially coming from you, Taito.

00:12:55.160 --> 00:12:56.260
Yeah?

00:12:56.260 --> 00:13:00.000
We'll steal the weapons.
And then we can use them to...

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.770
...take care of them while they're off guard.

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:06.930
Precisely. We'll do it tonight.

00:13:08.040 --> 00:13:11.350
Okay! Eat up!

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:12.840
Will do!

00:13:17.220 --> 00:13:21.920
Taito. Lady Laila and I will
keep them busy. Meanwhile...

00:13:21.920 --> 00:13:26.690
Yeah, I know! Quit repeating
yourself! It's simple!

00:13:26.690 --> 00:13:31.200
I feel uneasy whenever you say
something is simple, dumb brother.

00:13:31.200 --> 00:13:33.360
Quit calling me dumb!

00:13:35.600 --> 00:13:37.540
What do <i>you</i> want?!

00:13:39.140 --> 00:13:42.410
Laila! What brings you out here?

00:13:42.410 --> 00:13:47.480
Oh! Did you come all the way
out here to look for little ol' me?!

00:13:47.480 --> 00:13:48.950
No!

00:13:48.950 --> 00:13:51.620
Hey, you! Stay away from Laila!

00:13:51.620 --> 00:13:54.620
Will you get off my case,
you dumb brother?!

00:13:54.620 --> 00:13:56.960
Quit calling me dumb too!

00:13:56.960 --> 00:13:59.090
What are you doing here?

00:14:00.660 --> 00:14:04.930
It's a secret. But maybe
I can let <i>you</i> in on it, Laila!

00:14:04.930 --> 00:14:06.770
Yeah, tell us!

00:14:06.770 --> 00:14:08.840
I ain't tellin' <i>you</i>!

00:14:08.840 --> 00:14:11.240
Quit being so cheap!

00:14:11.240 --> 00:14:12.640
What's that?

00:14:13.680 --> 00:14:14.740
What is that?!

00:14:14.740 --> 00:14:18.250
--Linlin's mansion is that way!
--What?!

00:14:18.250 --> 00:14:22.620
Why now?! I thought it was
supposed to be tomorrow morning!

00:14:22.620 --> 00:14:23.990
H-hey!

00:14:23.990 --> 00:14:26.950
--Let's go, too!
--Y-yeah!

00:14:31.490 --> 00:14:32.830
How can this be?!

00:14:32.830 --> 00:14:34.160
What's going on?!

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:38.000
I thought they were gonna attack
after they got the weapons!

00:14:45.670 --> 00:14:47.140
Wh-what is this?!

00:14:47.140 --> 00:14:48.980
Well, well!

00:14:48.980 --> 00:14:52.980
I see you've showed up
alongside the enemy, Hosei!

00:14:52.980 --> 00:14:55.820
I had figured as much.

00:14:55.820 --> 00:14:56.950
What?!

00:14:56.950 --> 00:15:03.060
You've seemed strange since last night,
so I decided to make a move.

00:15:03.060 --> 00:15:09.290
As you can see, the weapons
arrived this afternoon.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:13.030
We need to hurry and rescue them!

00:15:13.030 --> 00:15:16.740
Chinjo and Linlin must still be inside!

00:15:16.740 --> 00:15:18.140
Yeah!

00:15:18.140 --> 00:15:20.230
Hold it right there.

00:15:25.250 --> 00:15:27.050
What are those?!

00:15:27.050 --> 00:15:29.050
These are really something!

00:15:29.050 --> 00:15:31.880
How many arrows do you think
they can shoot at once?

00:15:34.860 --> 00:15:39.190
Now that you understand, just sit there
and watch Chinjo and Linlin burn to death!

00:15:39.190 --> 00:15:40.730
If we don't do something...!

00:15:40.730 --> 00:15:43.430
Taito. I leave things here to you.

00:15:43.430 --> 00:15:44.570
You're not thinking of...?!

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:47.400
In the meantime, I will rescue them.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:48.840
Got it!

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:53.200
Fools!

00:15:58.850 --> 00:16:01.580
Shoot! Shoot! Shoot more!

00:16:06.550 --> 00:16:08.920
A-are they monsters?!

00:16:10.360 --> 00:16:12.220
I-I can't draw it!

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:19.930
Sir Chinjo! Lady Linlin!

00:16:27.140 --> 00:16:33.050
Damn! Peerless bow, my ass!
It's completely useless!

00:16:34.050 --> 00:16:35.540
The mansion!

00:16:38.450 --> 00:16:40.990
Chinjo! Linlin!

00:16:40.990 --> 00:16:42.090
Ryuko!

00:16:42.090 --> 00:16:43.790
They're both all right!

00:16:43.790 --> 00:16:45.550
Look after them!

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:52.390
This... is the Shuang Chan Bow!

00:16:56.800 --> 00:16:58.670
It's over now!

00:17:00.140 --> 00:17:01.940
--Laila!
--Linlin...!

00:17:01.940 --> 00:17:05.780
--Chinjo! Chinjo! Chinjo!
--Gotcha!

00:17:05.780 --> 00:17:10.410
Well done! Now kill her!
Kill Linlin at once!

00:17:11.790 --> 00:17:13.920
Damn it!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.750
You're too late!

00:17:19.690 --> 00:17:23.030
After all is said and done,
I'm the one who wins!

00:17:34.340 --> 00:17:38.110
This is it... This is my weapon!

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:44.850
Go, Shuang Chan Bow!

00:17:55.030 --> 00:17:57.520
Damn you!

00:17:58.470 --> 00:18:03.060
Crooked bastards can't shoot straight arrows!

00:18:04.340 --> 00:18:05.670
Damn!

00:18:09.710 --> 00:18:12.140
Damn! It won't budge!

00:18:13.380 --> 00:18:16.750
Linlin. Close your eyes, okay?

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:24.220
Okay, you can open them now.

00:18:33.770 --> 00:18:38.710
Thank you. You helped
restore peace to the town.

00:18:38.710 --> 00:18:41.680
We'll stop by again when we've
finished our business at the capital.

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:45.510
Yes. By then, I'll have made it
into the posting town it once was-

00:18:45.510 --> 00:18:49.920
no, even better-
and be waiting for you.

00:18:51.090 --> 00:18:54.390
Thanks, Hosei! You're a pretty good fighter!

00:18:54.390 --> 00:19:00.590
Right? Aren't I, though?
Hearing you say that makes me happy!

00:19:02.060 --> 00:19:03.530
Bye, Linlin!

00:19:03.530 --> 00:19:06.100
Yeah! Thanks!

00:19:06.100 --> 00:19:08.630
Well, we should be off.

00:19:12.970 --> 00:19:16.080
See you later, Mister!

00:19:16.080 --> 00:19:19.450
She's cute, waving so hard like that.

00:19:19.450 --> 00:19:22.420
Yeah, she is.

00:19:22.420 --> 00:19:26.090
Hold on! What are you doing here?!

00:19:26.090 --> 00:19:29.260
You were those guys' bodyguard!

00:19:29.260 --> 00:19:33.390
Getting this Shuang Chan Bow
is all I really cared about.

00:19:33.390 --> 00:19:35.060
You serious?

00:19:35.060 --> 00:19:37.130
Aw, don't be such a stick-in-the-mud.

00:19:37.130 --> 00:19:42.130
I'd follow Laila to the ends of
the earth if I had to. Right, Laila?

00:19:44.310 --> 00:19:46.670
Quit acting chummy!

00:19:46.670 --> 00:19:51.480
Your arrow barely hit the target,
just so you know! Just barely!

00:19:51.480 --> 00:19:56.350
Shut up! I never miss a target,
you dumb brother!

00:19:56.350 --> 00:19:58.520
Don't call me dumb!

00:19:58.520 --> 00:20:00.350
Well, shall we go, Laila?

00:20:00.350 --> 00:20:02.660
Quit acting like we're friends!

00:20:02.660 --> 00:20:05.030
I would totally kick the crap
out of you right now

00:20:05.030 --> 00:20:07.160
if you weren't Laila's brother!

00:20:07.160 --> 00:20:09.330
I'd like to see you try!
I'd like to see you try!

00:20:09.330 --> 00:20:10.460
Good grief...

00:20:10.460 --> 00:20:14.670
Looks like we've gained another
idiot. Men are so hopeless.

00:20:14.670 --> 00:20:18.000
--Just go back home!
--You're in no position to tell me that!

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:25.910
<i>Must the weak turn to</i>
<i>crime in order to survive?</i>

00:20:25.910 --> 00:20:28.450
<i>Just give yourself up</i>
<i>and come out, you damn thief!</i>

00:20:28.450 --> 00:20:31.280
<i>These kids have always</i>
<i>lived on their own, haven't they?</i>

00:20:31.280 --> 00:20:33.520
<i>I sympathize with their situation</i>.
<i>But that doesn't mean</i>--

00:20:33.520 --> 00:20:36.590
<i>Only someone who's</i>
<i>never starved could say that</i>.

00:20:36.590 --> 00:20:39.820
<i>Now, then. I guess it's</i>
<i>time to make my move</i>.

00:20:39.820 --> 00:20:43.090
<i>You! You're not getting away now!</i>

00:20:43.090 --> 00:20:46.360
<i>Is it strength they seek? Or a bond?</i>

00:20:46.360 --> 00:20:50.300
<i>On Hero Tales,</i>
<i>"Chapter Five: Ailing Empire."</i>

00:21:01.150 --> 00:21:04.480
<i>I hate it when people bully weaker people!</i>
